<span class="badge badge-success">Ticket Resolved</span>
<h1>Support Ticket Resolved</h1>
<p>Hello {{recipientName}},</p>
<p>Your support ticket has been marked as resolved by our IT technician. Please verify that the solution resolved the problem to your satisfaction.</p>

<div class="meta-box">
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td class="meta-label">Ticket ID:</td>
      <td class="meta-value"><strong>{{ticketNumber}}</strong></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="meta-label">Subject:</td>
      <td class="meta-value">{{title}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="meta-label">Resolution:</td>
      <td class="meta-value">{{resolution}}</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<p>You can view the full resolution summary, add comments, or reopen the ticket if the problem persists by clicking the button below:</p>

{{button "Review Resolution" actionUrl}}

<p style="margin-top: 24px;">Thank you for using CampusCare support,<br/>CampusCare IT Service Desk Team</p>
